{"name":"Beacon","hex":"#ebe8b9","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Beacon","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A minor city in Mahaska County, Iowa, United States.","A city in Dutchess County, New York, United States."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Beacon"}],"entries":[{"title":"Beacon","blocks":[{"text":"A beacon is an intentionally conspicuous device designed to attract attention to a specific location. A common example is the lighthouse, which draws attention to a fixed point that can be used to navigate around obstacles or into port. More modern examples include a variety of radio beacons that can be read on radio direction finders in all weather, and radar transponders that appear on radar displays."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beacon","wikidata":"Q7321258"},{"title":"Beacon (Two Door Cinema Club album)","blocks":[{"text":"Beacon is the second studio album by Northern Irish indie rock band Two Door Cinema Club, released by Kitsuné on 31 August 2012."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/b/b8/Two_Door_Cinema_Club_-_Beacon.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beacon_(Two_Door_Cinema_Club_album)","wikidata":"Q3282716"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2e/Beacon_at_Orontes_Bank.jpg/500px-Beacon_at_Orontes_Bank.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2e/Beacon_at_Orontes_Bank.jpg/1280px-Beacon_at_Orontes_Bank.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2e/Beacon_at_Orontes_Bank.jpg/500px-Beacon_at_Orontes_Bank.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A navigational beacon denoting the presence of Orontes Bank off Port Vincent, South A